{"seq":1,"slug":"sun-moon-position","title":"日月轨迹","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-time-day-night/day-night/sun-moon-position","wordCount":1540,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"日月轨迹\">日月轨迹</h1><p>清晨的太阳从东方地平线斜射，正午高悬头顶把影子缩成一团，黄昏又坠向西边拉出长长的暖色阴影——这条太阳划过天空的弧线，是玩家潜意识里判断「现在几点」的最强信号。要让这条弧线动起来，得把 <a href=\"../foundations/game-time-abstraction\">游戏时间抽象</a> 里那个 0 到 1 的相位，翻译成太阳与月亮在天球上的真实方向。这一篇只管「算方向」，算出的方向如何渲成天空见 <a href=\"sky-atmosphere\">天空与大气</a>，如何驱动光照见 <a href=\"time-lighting\">昼夜光照</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>天体在观察者头顶的位置，用两个角描述：<strong>高度角 (altitude)</strong>，天体在地平线之上的仰角，0 度在地平线、90 度在头顶；<strong>方位角 (azimuth)</strong>，天体投影到地面后相对正北的水平转角。游戏要做的，是把游戏时间映射到这一对角，再转成一个方向向量去摆方向光和天体盘。</p>\n<p>精度分两档。<strong>艺术化模型</strong>：不管真实天文，直接让太阳绕一根固定轴匀速转一圈对应一天，简单到一行公式，绝大多数游戏够用。<strong>物理化模型</strong>：引入纬度、一年中的第几天（决定太阳赤纬）、甚至经度时区，算出真实的日出方位随季节漂移——飞行模拟、天文教育类才需要。下图是从相位到方向向量的转换链：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[日内相位 phase 0..1] --&gt; B[时角 hourAngle]&#10;    C[纬度 latitude] --&gt; D[高度角 / 方位角]&#10;    E[一年第几天 dayOfYear] --&gt; F[太阳赤纬 declination]&#10;    B --&gt; D&#10;    F --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; G[方向向量 sunDir]&#10;    G --&gt; H[摆放方向光与太阳盘]&#10;    A --&gt; I[月亮独立轨道 + 相位偏移]&#10;    I --&gt; J[月亮方向 + 月相]\">flowchart TD\n    A[日内相位 phase 0..1] --&gt; B[时角 hourAngle]\n    C[纬度 latitude] --&gt; D[高度角 / 方位角]\n    E[一年第几天 dayOfYear] --&gt; F[太阳赤纬 declination]\n    B --&gt; D\n    F --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; G[方向向量 sunDir]\n    G --&gt; H[摆放方向光与太阳盘]\n    A --&gt; I[月亮独立轨道 + 相位偏移]\n    I --&gt; J[月亮方向 + 月相]</pre><p>两档模型的取舍对比如下，先选档再动手，避免一上来就陷进天文公式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>艺术化模型</th>\n<th>物理化模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输入</td>\n<td>仅相位</td>\n<td>相位 + 纬度 + 一年第几天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日出方位</td>\n<td>永远正东</td>\n<td>随季节在东偏南/北间漂移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现量</td>\n<td>一根轴匀速旋转</td>\n<td>球面三角公式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用</td>\n<td>绝大多数游戏</td>\n<td>模拟/教育/真实感标杆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>季节耦合</td>\n<td>手动调日长</td>\n<td>自动（赤纬随天变化）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"艺术化模型-一根轴转一圈\">艺术化模型：一根轴转一圈</h2><p>最常用的做法把太阳钉在一个绕固定轴旋转的圆盘上。设相位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p \\in [0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，正午（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span>）太阳在最高点，午夜（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>）在最低点（地平线之下）。最简形式让太阳高度角随相位走一条正弦：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>altitude</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>0.25</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{altitude} = \\alpha_{\\max} \\cdot \\sin\\!\\left(2\\pi \\left(p - 0.25\\right)\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">altitude</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.25</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是正午最大仰角（赤道附近接近 90 度，高纬度更低）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=0.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.25</span></span></span></span></span>（清晨 6 点）时正弦为 0，太阳恰在地平线——日出；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.75</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=0.75</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.75</span></span></span></span></span>（傍晚 6 点）日落。把高度角配上一个匀速增长的方位角（东到西），就得到一条像样的日弧。</p>\n<p>在引擎里通常更直接：把方向光的旋转直接绑定相位。以 Unreal Engine 为例，方向光的俯仰角（pitch）随相位线性插值即可；UE5.5 起的 Day Sequence actor 把太阳、月亮、大气、云的时间控制收敛到一个集中节点，本质上也是用一条时间线驱动方向光的旋转（见 Epic 官方 Sky Atmosphere 文档）。一个引擎无关的最小实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// phase 0..1，太阳绕 X 轴旋转，0.25 日出 0.75 日落&#10;Quaternion SunRotation(float phase) {&#10;    float angle = (phase - 0.25f) * 360f; // 日出时 0 度（地平线）&#10;    return Quaternion.Euler(angle, sunYaw, 0f);&#10;}&#10;Vector3 SunDirection(float phase) =&gt; SunRotation(phase) * Vector3.forward;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// phase 0..1，太阳绕 X 轴旋转，0.25 日出 0.75 日落</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Quaternion SunRotation(float phase) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float angle = (phase - 0.25f) * 360f; // 日出时 0 度（地平线）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return Quaternion.Euler(angle, sunYaw, 0f);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Vector3 SunDirection(float phase) => SunRotation(phase) * Vector3.forward;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"物理化模型-纬度与赤纬\">物理化模型：纬度与赤纬</h2><p>要让日出方位随季节漂移、让北欧的冬天日短到只有几小时，就得引入真实天文量。两个关键输入：观察者<strong>纬度</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span> 和<strong>太阳赤纬</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>（太阳直射点的纬度，随一年中的第几天 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><msup><mn>23.44</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 23.44^\\circ</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7574em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">23.4</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 间摆动）。赤纬的常用近似：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>23.44</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>81</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>365</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta = 23.44^\\circ \\cdot \\sin\\!\\left(\\frac{2\\pi (N - 81)}{365}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7241em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">23.4</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7241em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">365</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">81</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>再由时角 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span>（正午为 0，每小时 15 度）算高度角 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>δ</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sin a = \\sin\\phi \\sin\\delta + \\cos\\phi \\cos\\delta \\cos H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这就是球面天文的标准解，也是 Hosek–Wilkie 等物理天空模型要求的太阳位置输入。游戏里不必追求秒级精度，但用上赤纬就能「免费」拿到正确的季节性日照变化——夏至日长、冬至日短自动浮现，无需手调。这条季节耦合正是 <a href=\"../foundations/in-game-calendars\">游戏内日历</a> 里季节慢变量在昼夜系统的体现，季节如何改日照阈值见 <a href=\"../systems/seasons-weather-link\">季节与生态联动</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"月亮-独立轨道与月相\">月亮：独立轨道与月相</h2><p>月亮不是「夜里的太阳」，它有自己的脾气。两点要做对。其一，<strong>轨道独立</strong>：月亮的升落不该和太阳严格反相，否则永远是「日落即月升」，太假。给月亮一个略不同于一天的周期（现实里约 24.8 小时升落一次），让它逐日漂移，玩家才会注意到「今晚月亮位置和昨天不一样」。其二，<strong>月相</strong>：月亮被太阳照亮的比例随月相周期变化，常用一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>（新月）到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>（满月）再回 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 的标量，由月球相对太阳的相位角决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>illumination</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{illumination} = \\frac{1 - \\cos\\theta}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">illumination</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 是太阳—月亮的相位角。这个标量既驱动月面贴图的明暗遮罩，也决定夜晚环境光强度——满月之夜该比新月亮得多。月相数值如何渲成月面见 <a href=\"sky-atmosphere\">天空与大气</a>，月光如何并入夜间环境光见 <a href=\"time-lighting\">昼夜光照</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>天体位置归结为高度角与方位角一对参数，再转成方向向量去摆方向光与天体盘。</li>\n<li>先选档：绝大多数游戏用「一根轴匀速转一圈」的艺术化模型即可，模拟/教育才上物理化模型。</li>\n<li>物理化模型引入纬度与赤纬，能免费获得日出方位漂移与夏长冬短的真实季节日照。</li>\n<li>月亮要有独立轨道（不与太阳严格反相）和月相标量，月相同时驱动月面明暗与夜间环境光。</li>\n<li>本篇只产出方向与相位等参数，天空渲染与光照驱动分别在后续两篇消费这些输出。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 兄弟篇：<a href=\"sky-atmosphere\">天空与大气</a> —— 消费太阳方向渲染天空与月面；<a href=\"time-lighting\">昼夜光照</a> —— 消费太阳方向与色温驱动光照；<a href=\"../foundations/in-game-calendars\">游戏内日历</a> —— 季节如何改变赤纬与日照时长。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：方向光照亮场景的着色实现见 <a href=\"../../game-graphics/lighting-and-shadow/lighting-models\">光照模型</a>；天体方向作为程序化噪声/坐标变换的应用基础见 <a href=\"../../shader-programming/foundations/coordinate-spaces\">坐标空间</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"日月轨迹","id":"日月轨迹"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"艺术化模型：一根轴转一圈","id":"艺术化模型-一根轴转一圈"},{"level":2,"text":"物理化模型：纬度与赤纬","id":"物理化模型-纬度与赤纬"},{"level":2,"text":"月亮：独立轨道与月相","id":"月亮-独立轨道与月相"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"游戏内日历","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-time-day-night/foundations/in-game-calendars"},"next":{"title":"天空与大气","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-time-day-night/day-night/sky-atmosphere"}}